      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_03b",
      "hash64": "ADA24F915EEB850C",
      "text": "Well, don’t worry. I’m sure you’ll get a hang of\\nthings soon! In the meantime, feel free to come\\r\\nsee me if you need help with anything![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
